    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29757" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Moschi</span></b> , ōrum,
		m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				people between the Black and the Caspian Seas</i>, Mela, 1, 2,
			5; 3, 5, 4; <i><span class="en">Luc. 3, 270</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 4,
				4, § 29</span></i>.— Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Moschĭcus</span></b> , a,
				um, <i>adj., Moschian</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 27,
				27, § 99</span></i>; Mela, 1, 19, 13.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Moschus</span></b> , a, um,
				<i>adj., Moschian</i>, Mela, 1, 19: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mons,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					5, 27, 27, § 99</span></i>
			.</div>
